            {"question":"Which of the following is a general source of food contamination?","options":["Cross-contamination between raw and cooked food","Proper storage","Safe cooking temperatures","Vaccination only"],"answer":"Cross-contamination between raw and cooked food"},
            {"question":"Which practice BEST represents a food safety measure?","options":["Handwashing and clean utensils","Ignoring storage conditions","Mixing raw and cooked food","Avoiding food inspection"],"answer":"Handwashing and clean utensils"},
