            {"question":"Which vaccine is used for prevention of both measles and mumps?","options":["MMR vaccine","DTaP vaccine","Tdap vaccine","Meningococcal vaccine"],"answer":"MMR vaccine"},
            {"question":"A child develops a mild fever, postauricular lymphadenopathy, and a fine pink rash beginning on the face. Which disease is MOST likely?","options":["Measles","Rubella","Mumps","Pertussis"],"answer":"Rubella"},
